*** Add File:docs/runbooks/optionA_allclouds_runbook.md
+# Option A runbook — Provision KMS + Rekor (AWS / GCP / Azure) and enforce Rekor in CI; Vault HA + audit forwarding
+
+Prereqs:
+- Terraform installed and cloud provider credentials configured for the target account(s).
+- GitHub CLI (gh) installed and authenticated.
+- kubectl and helm available to deploy Vault chart in your cluster.
+- Vault token with admin privileges for enabling audit devices.
+
+High-level steps:
+1) AWS
+   - cd terraform/aws && terraform init && terraform apply
+   - Capture outputs: aws_cosign_kms_arn, aws_rekor_endpoint
+   - Set GitHub secrets: ./ops/ci/set_github_secrets_allclouds.sh <owner/repo> "kms://<aws-arn>" "http://<rekor-ip>"
+
+2) GCP
+   - cd terraform/gcp && terraform init && terraform apply -var='gcp_project=YOUR_PROJECT'
+   - Capture outputs: gcp_cosign_kms_resource_id, gcp_rekor_endpoint
+   - Set GitHub secrets: ./ops/ci/set_github_secrets_allclouds.sh <owner/repo> "gcpkms://projects/.../cryptoKeys/..." "http://<rekor-ip>"
+
+3) Azure
+   - cd terraform/azure && terraform init && terraform apply
+   - Capture outputs: azure_key_vault_key_id, azure_rekor_endpoint
+   - Set GitHub secrets: ./ops/ci/set_github_secrets_allclouds.sh <owner/repo> "azurekeyvault://<vault-url>/keys/<key>" "http://<rekor-fqdn>"
+
+4) Deploy Vault HA
+   - helm repo add hashicorp https://helm.releases.hashicorp.com
+   - helm install vault hashicorp/vault -f ops/vault/vault-ha-values.yaml --namespace vault --create-namespace
+   - Ensure Vault unsealed and accessible; run ops/vault/enable_audit_forwarding.sh with VAULT_ADDR and VAULT_TOKEN set.
+
+5) CI enforcement
+   - Ensure .github/workflows/enforce_rekor_on_promotion.yml is present in your repo.
+   - Test by producing a signed artifact using cosign (on a runner/host with KMS permissions):
+       echo "test" > /tmp/test.bin
+       cosign sign-blob --key "kms://<COSIGN_KMS_ARN>" /tmp/test.bin
+   - Upload artifact and ensure Rekor entry exists (rekor-cli search ...), then run the GitHub workflow manually or push a test Build and check “Enforce Rekor on Promotion” run.
+
+6) Vault rotation marker & monitor
+   - Apply k8s cronjob k8s/cronjobs/rotate_vault_marker.yaml in aegis-system to write rotation timestamps every 6 hours.
+   - Run ops/validation/readiness_check.py (or the full CI workflow) to validate.
+
+Notes & next steps:
+- Replace demo Rekor VM deployments with k8s/Helm Rekor chart in production for HA and easier scaling.
+- Ensure COSIGN_KEY is stored in Vault / ExternalSecrets for runners and rotation workflows are integrated with your secret operator.
+- Update SIEM fluent-bit configuration to forward vault_audit.log to your SIEM.
+
